# Minimal 1-D real-BVH motion space: a single walk node over one curvature axis
# (0 = wide curve, 1 = tight). Example paths resolve relative to THIS spec file
# (specs/), hence ../BVH. Both clips share one skeleton group (see
# docs/MOTION_CORPUS.md); cross-group clips are rejected as a skeleton mismatch.
# The registration line cycle-normalizes the multi-cycle clips on LeftAnkle so
# their contact structures match (without it the anchor counts disagree).
node walk 1
registration walk LeftAnkle LeftAnkle,RightAnkle 3 1
example walk 0.0 ../BVH/walkCurve.bvh
example walk 1.0 ../BVH/walkTightCurve.bvh
edge walk walk
# Self-edge thresholds tuned for duration-true generated clips (see
# walk_curvature.pmg_spec); the default thresholds reject every sample.
edge_config walk walk 1.5 2.0 12 60 7
